### create todos
POST http://localhost:8080/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "init",
	"completed": true
}

### create todos by miss title
POST http://localhost:8000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"completed": true
}

### get all todos
GET http://localhost:8000/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### get todo by id, valid id
GET http://localhost:8000/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### get todo by id, invalid id
GET http://localhost:8000/todos/100

### update todo
PUT http://localhost:8000/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "update",
	"completed": false
}


### delete todo by id, valid id
DELETE http://localhost:8000/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### delete todo by id, invalid id
DELETE http://localhost:8000/todos/100


